    "title": "Crowley volunteer leads efforts to recall Governor Jeff Landry - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jasmine Dean ,\n2 hours ago CROWLEY, La. (KLFY) — A statewide petition to recall Louisiana Governor Jeff Landry is actively seeking signatures, with a local volunteer collecting endorsements in Acadiana. Jacqunette Guidry is urging registered voters in Crowley to sign the document. The recall effort requires a total of 600,000 signatures across Louisiana, which... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
